abstract: >-
  GLPI plugin to run an ISO/IEC 27001 information security management system: risks, Statement of Applicability, controls and evidence, audits, policies, incidents, vulnerabilities, suppliers, GDPR and compliance frameworks (NIS2, DORA, AI Act, HDS, PCI DSS, SOC 2 and custom frameworks).
